un4L1tOQWSlxi-XUNg-x0Mvvy3mfYjg&oe=6B0857B1"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00004.png", "id": "1363702279023913", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507847457_1363702282357246_2593559578760018675_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jz9jU_lb8NEQ7kNvwEZ_k-1&_nc_oc=AdplSPZVehuiyGXnD1mDtPpeg98GFJ9BIkOPpfb5TdnRq0xr96jRuL5doGx_VFVRudI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSL-gYRBmApJBYRrfhbBpjPxDlrdG5-sfUYoFTVF027pg&oe=6B0867F6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Diagnosing and Replacing Contactors", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Diagnosing and Replacing Contactors is an immersive VR training application designed exclusively for learners enrolled in ImmerseLearn\u2019s Diagnosing and Replacing Contactors micro-credential program.\n\nThis interactive simulation allows learners to develop practical skills in identifying faulty contactors, performing diagnostic procedures, understanding electrical system safety protocols, and executing proper replacement procedures in a realistic virtual environment. The application is built to provide hands-on technical experience that reinforces course concepts through experiential learning and real-world practice.\n\nPlease note that this application is not intended for general public use. Access is restricted only to individuals officially enrolled in the ImmerseLearn micro-credential program as part of their required hands-on training experience.", "short_description": "Diagnosing and Replacing Contactors is a VR training application developed as part of ImmerseLearn\u2019s Diagnosing and Replacing Contactors micro-credential program. This immersive simulation provides hands-on technical training in contactor diagnostics, troubleshooting, and replacement procedures. Access is exclusively available to learners officially enrolled in the ImmerseLearn program."}]}, "developer_name": null, "develope